ENGLISH — PROPRIETARY, SOURCE-AVAILABLE FOR REVIEW ONLY

The contents of this repository (documentation, diagrams and the selected
source code published under code/) are made available for the sole purpose of
technical review — by evaluation committees, investors and partners.

You MAY: read and review the materials and the published source code.

You MAY NOT, without prior written permission of the copyright holder:
  1. use the published code, in whole or in part, for any purpose;
  2. copy, reproduce, distribute or sublicense the materials;
  3. create derivative works based on the materials;
  4. use the materials for any commercial purpose;
  5. use the published code to train machine learning models.

This repository contains only a SELECTED PART of the product source code.
The ShNK normative database, the engine's dictionaries and matching rules,
the validation corpus and the project documentation of our clients are NOT
published here: they remain protected intellectual property of the copyright
holder and of the respective clients. Consequently, the published code cannot
produce cost estimates on its own.

These materials constitute neither a public offer nor a license to use the
IISMETA software product.

